OL,3,GNEWSANew ID rules at tips spark
OL,4,Afly-tipping fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew rules requiring people using
OL,7,FGreater Manchester's tips to prove they
OL,8,Flive in the region are to be rolled out
OL,9,Ffrom January, despite concerns that it
OL,10,Fcould lead to fly tipping and long
OL,11,F"passport-style" queues.
OL,13,FGreater Manchester Combined Authority's
OL,14,F(GMCA) new system is being brought in
OL,15,Famid fears that dump closures in
OL,16,Fneighbouring counties are pushing
OL,17,Fpeople to travel to Greater Manchester
OL,18,Fand use its recycling centres for free.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
