OL,3,GNEWSANew ID rules at tips spark
OL,4,Afly-tipping fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Peter Crossen said he feared
OL,7,F"passport-style queues at tips", while
OL,8,Fcouncillor David Meller said he was
OL,9,Fconcerned it could increase
OL,10,Ffly-tipping.
OL,12,FThe GMCA has been approached for
OL,13,Fcomment.
